@baseUrl = http://localhost:5131
# Paste a token from the login response here to call the protected endpoints.
@token = PASTE_JWT_HERE

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register an employer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employer@example.com",
  "password": "TestUser@12345",
  "role": "Employer"
}

### Register a job seeker
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "seeker@example.com",
  "password": "TestUser@12345",
  "role": "JobSeeker"
}

### Log in
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employer@example.com",
  "password": "TestUser@12345"
}

### Wrong password: send 5 times to lock the account for 15 minutes (still a plain 401);
### send 11 times within a minute to get 429 Too Many Requests from the rate limiter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employer@example.com",
  "password": "Wrong@12345"
}

### Change my password (204; wrong current password or weak new one gives 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "TestUser@12345",
  "newPassword": "NewTestUser@12345"
}

### Who am I (from the token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Public job list, optionally filtered
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Job?jobType=FullTime&location=Remote

### Public job list: search + paging (response is {items, totalCount, page, pageSize})
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Job?search=developer&page=1&pageSize=10

### Public job list: invalid page size (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Job?pageSize=500

### One job
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Job/1

### Employer: create a job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Job
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Junior .NET Developer",
  "description": "Build and maintain ASP.NET Core APIs.",
  "jobType": "FullTime",
  "jobLocation": "Hybrid",
  "salaryRange": "80k - 120k PKR",
  "city": "Lahore",
  "experienceLevel": "Junior",
  "applicationDeadline": "2027-01-31T23:59:00+05:00",
  "skills": ["C#", "ASP.NET Core", "SQL Server"]
}

### Employer: create my company profile (409 if I already have one)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/EmployerProfile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Example Software House",
  "website": "https://example.com",
  "about": "Product engineering for local and international clients.",
  "city": "Lahore"
}

### Employer: my company profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/EmployerProfile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Skill autocomplete (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Skill?search=net

### Employer: my jobs (open and closed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Job/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Employer: only my open jobs (also: closed, all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Job/mine?status=open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Employer: applicants for one of my jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Job/1/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Employer: applicant's candidate profile + education (404 if the job isn't mine)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/JobApplication/1/candidate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Employer: move an application forward
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/JobApplication/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "UnderReview"
}

### Job seeker: apply (no body is also fine; 409 after the application deadline)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Job/1/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coverLetter": "I have two years of ASP.NET Core experience and would love to join your team."
}

### Job seeker: create my profile with CV link, experience and skills
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/CandidateProfile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ayesha Khan",
  "headline": "Junior .NET Developer",
  "city": "Lahore",
  "country": "Pakistan",
  "cvUrl": "https://example.com/cv/ayesha.pdf",
  "yearsOfExperience": 2,
  "experienceLevel": "Junior",
  "skills": ["C#", "asp.net core", "SQL Server"]
}

### Job seeker: my applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Job/my-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Job seeker: withdraw
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/JobApplication/1/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
